I see. You can need self_contained to be FALSE, e.g.

---
title: "Untitled"
output:
  html_document:
    self_contained: no

---

```{r pressure, echo=FALSE}
plot(pressure)
```

Or if you do want a self-contained HTML file, keep_md: yes may also
preserve the figure directory.

Regards,
Yihui
